@Itja to ensure that this isn't a problem introduced recently by the new `LibreBlock` system can you please try installing an older version to see if the same problem exists there:

https://github.com/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/releases/download/2017.11.13/xDrip-plus-20171113-20a4313.apk

xDrip allows any version to be installed over the top of any other so you don't need to uninstall.
